OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre requires renovation
OL,4,Aworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre requires #100,000 in
OL,7,Frenovations, a report has revealed.
OL,9,FWoodford Park Leisure Centre in Reading
OL,10,Fis managed by Woodley Town Council, and
OL,11,Ffeatures a five-court sports hall, a 3G
OL,12,Ffootball pitch, and an outdoor paddling
OL,13,Fpool.
OL,15,FA report by town clerk Kevin Murray
OL,16,Fstates it requires a sizeable
OL,17,Finvestment to replace its existing
OL,18,Fdrainage system and fire doors.
OL,20,FShort-term repairs and clearance works
OL,21,Ftook place earlier in the year.
